title: ZhiWei
abstract: >-
  Self-hosted, single-binary infrastructure monitoring platform for indie
  developers and one-person companies — resource monitoring, service
  health, certificate management, remote operations, alerting, and MCP
  integration. One human plus one agent, managing N machines.
